                            	   514: 
                            	   515: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:0003A57E 0003A58A        	   516:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A582 0003A664        	   517:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
