                            	  4912: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003C4C2 0003C4CE        	  4913:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003C4C6 0003C532        	  4914:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
