                            	  5206: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5207:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5208:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5209:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5210:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5211:     ;
                            	  5212:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5213:     ;
                            	  5214:     ; In major state $30, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $40.
                            	  5215:     ;
